(exclude ($AnchorSolidBlock $Disjoint) "$Disjoint and $Inside each only reject an assembly, so wherever a case that takes one of them gives a grid, the case that takes $OverlapAllowed and $ClipAssembly in its place gives the same grid. The concept case is the one case that takes either.")
(exclude ($AnchorSolidBlock $Inside) "$Disjoint and $Inside each only reject an assembly, so wherever a case that takes one of them gives a grid, the case that takes $OverlapAllowed and $ClipAssembly in its place gives the same grid. The concept case is the one case that takes either.")
(exclude ($ConnectorDerived $Disjoint) "$Disjoint and $Inside each only reject an assembly, so wherever a case that takes one of them gives a grid, the case that takes $OverlapAllowed and $ClipAssembly in its place gives the same grid. The concept case is the one case that takes either.")
(exclude ($ConnectorDerived $Inside) "$Disjoint and $Inside each only reject an assembly, so wherever a case that takes one of them gives a grid, the case that takes $OverlapAllowed and $ClipAssembly in its place gives the same grid. The concept case is the one case that takes either.")
(exclude ($Disjoint $ClipAssembly) "$Disjoint and $Inside each only reject an assembly, so wherever a case that takes one of them gives a grid, the case that takes $OverlapAllowed and $ClipAssembly in its place gives the same grid. The concept case is the one case that takes either.")
(exclude ($OverlapAllowed $Inside) "$Disjoint and $Inside each only reject an assembly, so wherever a case that takes one of them gives a grid, the case that takes $OverlapAllowed and $ClipAssembly in its place gives the same grid. The concept case is the one case that takes either.")
(exclude ($Disjoint &bg=$Derived) "subsumed by the case that takes $OverlapAllowed and $ClipAssembly")

